    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pumpkin Hack</strong> is a <strong>third-person multiplayer action game</strong> with a mix of <strong>stealth</strong> and <strong>combat mechanics</strong>. Players start as regular pumpkins, blending into the environment to avoid detection. You can <strong>crawl, walk, and sprint</strong> to outmaneuver enemies \u2014 but when the time is right, transform into a monstrous form with powerful scythe attacks. Collect seeds to refill stamina, dodge enemy strikes, and bait opponents into traps. Strategic hiding and timing are key to survival!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pumpkin Hack</strong> is a <strong>third-person multiplayer action game</strong> with a mix of <strong>stealth</strong> and <strong>combat mechanics</strong>. Players start as regular pumpkins, blending into the environment to avoid detection. You can <strong>crawl, walk, and sprint</strong> to outmaneuver enemies \u2014 but when the time is right, transform into a monstrous form with powerful scythe attacks. Collect seeds to refill stamina, dodge enemy strikes, and bait opponents into traps. Strategic hiding and timing are key to survival!</p>",
    "short_description": "Pumpkin Hack features fast-paced multiplayer matches with strategic stealth and intense combat. Master your transformation, outsmart enemies, and dominate the battlefield in dynamic, pumpkin-filled arenas.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
